 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology Co., Ltd",
 "title": "ES2AW to ES2JW: 2 A super fast recovery rectifiers, 50 V to 600 V, SOD-123FL",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 1.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A family of seven glass-passivated chip rectifiers in the flat-lead SOD-123FL surface-mount case, rated 2.0 A average forward current with reverse ratings from 50 V (ES2AW) to 600 V (ES2JW). Reverse recovery is 35 ns maximum, and a single 8.3 ms half-sine surge of 50 A is allowed. Uses named for it are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling, DC/DC converters and polarity protection. ES2JW is the 600 V member, with 1.68 V maximum forward drop at 2 A.",
 "key_figures": [
